WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,040
you just said

2
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,960
You are Class S, right? Captain

3
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:08,370
It's 40 points

4
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:10,050
I've heard about it

5
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:12,610
You only caught three specific people from Class S.

6
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:14,890
That's extra credit, right?

7
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:16,610
Did I forget to tell you

8
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:17,850
Even if we are out

9
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:19,130
Credits will not be reset

10
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:21,370
Each of us has purchased 20 credits in bulk

11
00:00:21,370 --> 00:00:22,690
So even if we can’t reach the end

12
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:24,530
You will not lose the credits you have already earned.

13
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:26,090
We don't want to fight you either

14
00:00:26,090 --> 00:00:28,130
After all, your team is pretty good.

15
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:29,170
But after chasing for so long

16
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:30,690
You can never leave empty-handed

17
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:32,810
So today we only need him

18
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:34,090
Don't think I don't know

19
00:00:34,090 --> 00:00:36,830
You guys came here later to pick up the leaks.

20
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:38,930
If you really want to steal it

21
00:00:38,930 --> 00:00:41,330
It seems that we have one more person than you, so it doesn’t matter.

22
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:42,650
Barefoot anyway

23
00:00:42,650 --> 00:00:45,960
Don’t worry if you are not afraid of wearing shoes

24
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:47,240
We are all classmates

25
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:49,920
We won't hurt him

26
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:51,800
We're not some outlaws.

27
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:53,400
Besides, it’s still live broadcast
